      Welcome to Tales of Corsairs Online!
_
_Server rates:
_  EXP 3x   Drop 1x   Fairy growth 4x
_
_New in this version:
_  1366x768 window and new interface
_  HP, SP and EXP numbers on the bars
_  New camera distance
_
_Features:
_1. Rebirth: players above level 75 can
_   use a rebirth card or rebirth quest.
_2. Sacred War: Level 66+ use the entrance
_   outside Shaitan City (979, 3708).
_   Level 45-65 use the entrance outside
_   Icicle City (1450, 613).
_
_Good luck, and have fun at sea!